#: templates/portfolio/home.html:8
msgid "Hi, I'm <span class=\"accent\">Pablo Dominguez Viera</span>"
msgstr "Hola, soy <span class=\"accent\">Pablo Dominguez Viera</span>"

#: templates/portfolio/home.html:10
msgid ""
"<strong>Full-Stack Developer.</strong> I build automation tools, data "
"analysis and real-world web portfolios: from scrapers and cloners to machine"
" learning models and end-to-end Django apps."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Full-Stack Developer.</strong> Construyo herramientas de "
"automatización, análisis de datos y portfolios web reales: desde scrapers y "
"clonadores hasta modelos de machine learning y apps Django de punta a punta."

#: templates/portfolio/home.html:13
msgid "View projects"
msgstr "Ver proyectos"

#: templates/portfolio/home.html:23
msgid "Who builds this"
msgstr "Quién construye esto"

#: templates/portfolio/home.html:26
msgid ""
"I'm Pablo Dominguez Viera (<strong>Ocultwolf</strong> on GitHub), a Python "
"developer focused on automation, backend systems and agent architectures."
msgstr ""
"Soy Pablo Dominguez Viera (<strong>Ocultwolf</strong> en GitHub), "
"desarrollador Python enfocado en automatización, sistemas backend y "
"arquitecturas de agentes."

#: templates/portfolio/home.html:27
msgid ""
"My flagship project is <strong>JARVIS P.D.</strong>, a multi-agent system "
"where agents propose and deterministic services validate and materialize, "
"with every phase audited before moving on. This very portfolio grew out of "
"<strong>ClonadorProfesional</strong>, a web cloner I built to replicate real"
" interfaces."
msgstr ""
"Mi proyecto de referencia es <strong>JARVIS P.D.</strong>, un sistema "
"multiagente donde los agentes proponen y servicios deterministas validan y "
"materializan, con cada fase auditada antes de avanzar. Este mismo portfolio "
"nace de <strong>ClonadorProfesional</strong>, un clonador web que construí "
"para replicar interfaces reales."

